{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14102120","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14102120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1410212001:1":{"text":"플린, 마침 잘 오셨습니다! 오늘 광산 쪽에 무슨 문제라도 생긴 건지, 원재료가 한 더미 빠져서 왔었는데, 이제야 도착했더라고요!","source_cn":"弗林，你来得正好！今天矿洞那边不知道出了什么问题，原料...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0889B6778264E238","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1410212002:1":{"text":"지금은 인원 배치가 모두 끝나서 이 물건을 운반할 만한 인력이 아예 없는데 제련소 쪽에서는 아직 물건을 기다리고 있어요...","source_cn":"目前人都已经安排开了，根本没有空余人手来运这批，但冶炼...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE882118F2FD65FBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410212003:1":{"text":"뭐라고?! 그럴 리가 없는데. 광산 사람들이 어찌... 아!","source_cn":"咦？！不应该啊，矿洞的人怎么会……啊，我知道了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4684E504E056AA54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410212004:1":{"text":"이것 참... 오늘 환영회 때 그리즐리를 불렀는데 아마 그쪽에 차질이 생긴 것 같군...","source_cn":"这真是，今天安排欢迎仪式的时候把老灰给叫过去了，估计是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6EA0986AE11D883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410212005:1":{"text":"어느 쪽에서 문제가 생겼든지 간에, 더 이상 지체돼선 안된다고요, 플린!","source_cn":"不管哪边的岔子，现在的东西可不能耽搁了，弗林！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE1A65E835C92851","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410212006:1":{"text":"일 얘기를 하니 인정사정없네요. 이 모습이야말로 저희가 잘 알고 있는 드워프죠.","source_cn":"说到干活一点也不客气了，这才是我们熟悉的矮人嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7B66004CC16CDCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410212007:1":{"text":"플린 촌장님, 저희 때문에 일어난 일이니 저희가 좀 도와드리는 것은 어떨지요?","source_cn":"弗林村长，既然事情是因我们而起，不如我们也搭把手？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDFCC94815E5E3B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410212008:1":{"text":"마침 저도 이곳의 제련 기술을 직접 보고 싶었고요.","source_cn":"正好，我也想见识见识贵地的冶炼工艺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1326D402B663976B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410212009:1":{"text":"안 됩니다, 안 돼요... 제가 어찌 염치 없게 레오프론 특사님께 이런 지저분하고 힘든 일을 부탁드릴 수 있겠습니까?","source_cn":"不行不行……哪能让耀光特使来干这些脏活儿累活儿？多不好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57E9A598283BAB3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1410212010:1":{"text":"플린! 사양할 때가 아닙니다! 제련소 쪽에서 또 또 또! 재촉하고 있다구요!","source_cn":"弗林！别客套了！冶炼所那边又又又又在催！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9A953F3F9742145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410212011:1":{"text":"음... 지금 바로 더 많은 인원을 배치하도록 하겠네! 귀한 손님분들을 생산에 참여하게 둘 순 없지.","source_cn":"呃……我立刻安排更多人手！一定不能让尊贵的客人参与生产——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB356634277BD73D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410212012:1":{"text":"플린 촌장님, 괜찮습니다. 참관의 일부라고 생각하고 도울 수 있도록 해주십시오.","source_cn":"弗林村长，别客气。就让我们来吧，就当是参观环节的一部分了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE67BB26078CC56D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1410212013:1":{"text":"그건... 그럼 특사님의 뜻에 따르겠습니다!","source_cn":"这……一切听特使您的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C2466C18395A7F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:工匠铁须":{"text":"장인 아이언비어드","source":"工匠铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:弗林":{"text":"플린","source":"弗林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:霍根":{"text":"호건","source":"霍根","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":4}}